-top: 0px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap; text-indent: -18.8pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0.1pt; font-size: 13pt;\">&nbsp; 화재예방 외벽 보</span><span style=\"text-indent: -18.8pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0.1pt; font-size: 13pt;\">강</span><span style=\"text-indent: -18.8pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 13pt;\">공사</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -18.8pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 11pt;\">(</span><span style=\"text-indent: -18.8pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 11pt;\">공사주관부서</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -18.8pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 11pt;\">:</span><span style=\"text-indent: -18.8pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 11pt;\">금오공대 시설안전과</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -18.8pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 11pt;\">)</span><span style=\"text-indent: -18.8pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 13pt;\">를 진행하오니 이용에 참고하여</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -18.8pt; font-size: 13pt;\"> </span><span style=\"text-indent: -18.8pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 13pt;\">주시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -18.8pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 13pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 18.8pt; padding-top: 0px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap; text-indent: -18.8pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 13pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 18.8pt; padding-top: 0px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap; text-indent: -18.8pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 13pt;\">6. 생활관비를 환불할 경우(취소신청), 재신청 불가하므로 환불 신청 전에 반드시 유의하여 주시기 바랍니다. <span style=\"background-color: rgb(124, 67, 177); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\"><a href=\"http://dorm.kumoh.ac.kr/dorm/sub0303.do?mode=view&amp;articleNo=99148&amp;article.offset=0&amp;articleLimit=10\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"tx-link\" style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">생활관 환불 바로가기(클릭)&nbsp;</span></a></span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 13pt; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13pt;\">  &nbsp;  <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 13pt; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13pt;\"><br></span></p><pre style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; overflow: auto; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: break-word; line-height: 1.625rem; word-break: keep-all;\"><p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-size: 13pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13pt;\"><br class=\"Apple-interchange-newline\">  &nbsp;  <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; text-align: center; word-break: keep-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 15pt;\">2020. 9. 8.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; text-align: center; word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 15pt;\">금오공과대학교</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; text-align: center; word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-family